# text = He said that in the 12 months ending 30th June last there were 39,000 such claims , of which 10,000 were withdrawn , 12,000 were settled by conciliation , and 17,000 went to tribunals , of which 5,500 were successful and 11,500 , 67·6 per cent . , were turned down .
