# text = It is strange that , in their paranoia about multinational companies , hon . Members opposite of the persuasion of the hon . Member for Nelson and Colne are prepared to accept all the benefits of North Sea oil and the enormous investment that multinational companies are continuing to put into that , yet continually deride those companies for their work .
