# text = If I can appeal to the heart as well as to the head of my right hon . Friend the Secretary of State I would beg him not to trample the feelings of loyal and peaceable Ulster people , many of whom are now canvassing and subscribing to a petition to this honourable House against the abolition of the governorship .
