# text = In those circumstances , does the right hon . Gentleman not think that the suggestion made by my hon . Friends today , that we should now be sensible enough to realise that , whatever Mr. Smith thinks , we should have a presence in Rhodesia able to guide us on how to consult majority opinion , is really an essential ?
