# text_id = 1548
# text = The evidence from the Road Research Laboratory of the Ministry of Transport and from a report published in 1969 by Dr. G. N. Mackay seems to show that in nearly half the road fatalities of persons aged 16 or more dying within 12 hours , death occurs within 5 minutes , and just over half the deaths occur in 10 minutes .
