# text_id = 1576
# text = I have said how absurd it is for the country to be short of doctors and for our hospitals to be forced to employ doctors who find it difficult to speak English , when nevertheless all over the country there are brilliant girls who have been denied the opportunity to enter a medical school because there is discrimination against women .
