# text = When I next meet my NATO ministerial colleagues collectively at the defence planning committee towards the end of this year , we shall discuss general defence issues , including those arising from the long - term defence programme , and also the report by the conference of national armaments directors to the council which deals with equipment standardisation and inter-operability .
