# text = Under the arrangements for last winter , the scheme offered help to three main categories of consumer who could be identified as having low incomes — that , is about 3 million recipients of supplementary , benefit , some 80,000 to 90,000 families receiving family income supplement and a further 3 million people receiving rate or rent rebate or rent allowance .
