# text_id = 1640
# text = I feel honoured and privileged in the acqaintanceship with ladies that I have enjoyed in my long life , and I confess that in this year of 1971 , so far as my experience goes , they are every bit as intelligent and able to control themselves , to look after themselves and to shape their lives as their male counterparts .
