# text_id = 1664
# text = In view of the gross abuse of parliamentary procedure by a number of Ministers who issued Written Answers on the Friday before Christmas , to avoid publicity , will the Leader of the House protect the position of back benchers and ensure that these Ministers make statements to the House on matters about which they chose not to be questioned ?
