# text_id = 1684
# text = I take the view — and I am open to correction — that this debate to - night will show that the complications are such that even if Parliament proceeds forthwith to pursue the points made in the Pearce / Donovan Report , which we are considering , it may well be two or three years before a decision is reached and the requisite legislation placed upon the Statute Book .
