# text = The other point I have made is that if Mrs. Brown feels that the interpretation of the law which I have mentioned is not correct she is perfectly entitled to put in motion the appeal procedure , and I shall be very glad when this debate is over to send an official to see her , to advise her and help her in every possible way on both these matters .
