# text = Is the hon . Gentleman aware that , in view of the announcement about super - development area status for the Clyde valley , there is a risk of adverse repercussions on the east end of the central belt of Scotland and that these may be particularly bad in Leith , which does not have full development area status , and Edinburgh , which is denied development area status altogether ?
