# text = Coming back to central London , W.C.1 , again not a fashionable area , and where one might expect a rather more reasonable standard of rent , a flat of two rooms , kitchen and bathroom , said to be " luxury " , although the advertisement does not say whether it has central heating , and " suiting two persons " , is offered at £ 22 a week .
