# text = It was my hope that during the time that Parliament was dissolved — and to that extent there was an unexpected hiatus during which progress could have been made — the objectors would be able to meet not just the existing promoters , who will cease to exist on Sunday night , but those who will take over the promotion of the Bill , including its handling in Committee .
