# text = I hope that the Under - Secretary of State will accept from the excellent speeches of my hon . Friend the Member for Woking ( Mr. Onslow ) and others , that we see real problems occurring if elections for the Westminster Parliament and the Assemblies take place within a certain period too close to each other , or if we have an Assembly election when Parliament has been dissolved .
