# text = Will he also remember that one of the reasons — perhaps the main reason — why we are discussing this statement in this way today — is not the effect of any co-operation that has existed during the past 12 months but the effect of what happened 12 months before , when the miners threw co-operation aside and decided to start to tackle the problems with which they were confronted ?
