# text = That is why I would still argue that there should be amateur directors of the Bank of England as well — people who deal with industry ; and I would have a few people who cut coal occasionally , or a farmer who can plough a field or milk a cow , helping sometimes by being part - time directors of the so - called nationalised Bank of England .
