# text_id = 1700
# text = Following the war with Japan , when many of these men and their families perished or were in enemy hands , a series of constitutional changes resulted in the Settlement of Singapore emerging as a separate independent State and the former Settlements of Penang , Malacca and Lubua being absorbed together with the Malay States other than the State of Brunei into what is now the independent Federation of Malaysia .
