# text_id = 1703
# text = In view of the anxiety caused by the disastrous relationship between the former Secretary of State for Industry and the British Steel Corporation , will the right hon . Gentleman now assure us and the nationalised industries that , so far as his new responsibilities are concerned , his policy will be to allow them maximum commercial managerial freedom with a minimum of day - to - day ministerial intervention ?
