# text_id = 1704
# text = If we had a free and open debate on all the issues involved , on the Floor of the House , if we explained precisely what was involved in our entry of the Common Market on the terms to which the Government have agreed , the country , which is already hostile , would become increasingly hostile and there would be no question of our entering on these terms .
