# text = An application for an order to be rescinded is not to be made more than once in any 12 months , and if an order is rescinded — and this is a point of some importance — nobody is to broadcast or to publish in any way particulars which would lead to the identification of a person who has been but is no longer subject to such a prohibited employment order .
