# text = I have some doubts on the particular provisions for keeping open redundant schools , but the Government have , in the last few days , set up a highly qualified , independent Working Party to look in part at the main issue raised by this Bill — the need for school management structures in Northern Ireland that will enable integrated education to occur wherever there is a demand for it .
