# text = Is the Leader of the House aware that if the predicted steel strike takes place early in the new year many of my hon . Friends who represent coal and steel communities and heavy industry areas will feel that it is necessary to come back to Parliament a week early to take the opportunity to educate the Tories into ending their lunatic policy of allowing imported coal into Britain ?
