# text = Secondly , the formula provided in the Amendment is bound to involve considerable complications ( they may be worth accepting ) in defining what should be included in , and what should be excluded from , the calculations resulting in the loss of which the Government should share a half , and a detailed checking by central Government over local government calculations of what is eligible and admissible for grant .
