# text = It is a curious fact that in this country we accept democracy in local government and in national government and we accept democratic procedures in a vast array of voluntary bodies and political parties — throughout our social life we have systematic elections of officers , committees , and so on — but as soon as we get to the factory gates it is assumed that democracy does not work .
