# text = My Lords , is my noble friend aware that during the period in which I had the honour to serve in the Ministry of Social Security when we raised this issue of asbestos , the trade union movement and other industrial organisations were vigilant about this growing menace of asbestosis , and they particularly asked that there should be an extension of and greater recruitment to the Factory Inspectorate .
