# text = But what the hon . Member for Worthing failed to say was that his right hon . Friend the Member for Altrincham and Sale ( Mr. Barber ) brought that Division upon himself by repeatedly refusing across the Floor of the House to give assurances that his administration would not impose VAT on essential foodstuffs in the context of the harmonisation requirements that we saw coming in the European Community .
