# text_id = 1719
# text = I would prefer it to come with consent by the Allies rather than as a result of an enforced unilateral decision in the United States — a decision regarded as being in their best interests , leaving a level of troops that can be sustained politically inside the United States , agreed within Congress by both major parties and , if possible , endorsed to some extent by Congressional resolution .
