# text_id = 1720
# text = I am aware of the campaign , headed by the right hon . Member for Birmingham , Sparkbrook ( Mr. Hattersley ) , which has given rise to certain claims by a handful of authorities . So far as I understand it , they work on the assumption that the local authorities of all other hon . Members should suffer so that they , this handful , should have more .
