# text = When he says that only 45 per cent . of contracts are now running over time , does not he think that , as the vast majority of the output of the British telecommunications industry is taken by the Post Office , the time is long overdue to establish in the development areas , such as the North - East , publicly - owned factories to produce telecommunications equipment ?
