# text_id = 1723
# text = In his long period as Leader , both as Leader of the House and as Leader of the Opposition since 1970 , Lord Shackleton has encouraged many Peers , not only those on his own side of the House but many Peers in all parts of the House ; and he guided our affairs over a period of six years or more with tact and wisdom , and invariable cheerfulness .
