# text_id = 1724
# text = We have to form a judgment as to whether this country will be more prosperous ; whether our political security will be greater along with the rest of Europe , and whether we shall be able , along with our European colleagues , — and I want to stress this again to possible critics — to make a greater contribution to raising living standards in the rest of the world .
