# text = In spite of the things that have been said about it — and I certainly would not trespass on the authority of my noble friend Lord Balogh — we must not forget that without North Sea oil the fundamental problems of industry would still have to be solved and with greater difficulty ; and , what is more , we should have to be going about them in the same way .
