# text_id = 1727
# text = The effect of the amendment would be that when application for custody of a child was being made by any person , whether a parent , or one of the persons now qualified to apply by virtue of the new statutory right contained in Clause 45 ( 1 ) , or a person applying under common law , the putative father might not be aware of the proceedings at all .
