# text_id = 1729
# text = I ask the Minister of State , in replying to the debate , to answer a question which was posed repeatedly in the Scottish devolution debates by my hon . Friend the Member for Aylesbury ( Mr. Raison ) : what will happen if , in the course of one year or of four years , the Government of the day decide that the economy requires massive cuts in public expenditure ?
