# text = I do not want to delay the passage of the Bill , but let me say that if I still have the privilege to remain Chairman of the Trustees , the first time that the Review Body meets — and I hope that that will not be too long — this is one of the recommendations that I would make to it , subject to the agreement of my fellow trustees .
