# text = I want to say a word about that White Paper , because my correspondence last year has led me seriously to doubt whether any of the Ministers responsible for forestry , or any of the Government officials who advised them , had ever read or heard of this very important White Paper ( Cmnd. 6447 ) upon which the whole of our post - war forest policy was based .
