# text_id = 1736
# text = Since the transferor and the transferee are free to decide who will bear the tax and thus , in effect , to decide whether the grossing up provision should come into effect , and whether we are talking about a gross or net gift , there is no good reason for giving them the further right by agreement in effect to limit the powers of the Revenue to collect the tax .
