# text = Given the background of great escalation in this activity , I should not be content were my right hon . Friend not to supplement the pamphlet with a circular to local education authorities stipulating specific requirements of leaders of teams in terms of competence , training and background and the ratio of those leaders to the personnel in the party vis -à - vis the aims and objects of the visit .
