# text = I will make no bones at all about the fact that the climate for public expenditure has become more difficult since May , owing to there having been no agreement yet on an incomes policy , but , as the House knows , the Government are looking very carefully at proposals for major increases in public expenditure and at the timing for the introduction of an educational maintenance allowance system .
