# text_id = 1739
# text = It has been said by many hon . Members that this system of allowances introduces means tests , and the point has been made , particularly by my hon . Friend the Member for Swindon ( Mr. David Stoddart ) , that when there are means tests it is rare for more than half or three - quarters of those eligible for benefits to apply for and get them .
