# text_id = 1740
# text = If shoddy goods , selling at inflated prices , are hawked around labelled " Made by the disabled " , especially the war disabled , when they are not , the general public , who on the whole are most generous and sympathetic , will not feel inclined to be so generous and sympathetic when a bona fide salesman calls or when they get an appeal letter in their post boxes .
