# text_id = 1741
# text = Is it not time that the Government urgently considered the integration of National Carriers Ltd. and Freightliners Ltd. with the railways as the first step towards an integrated transport system and getting rid of some of the absurd competition between the same sectors of the publicly - owned industry , as a presage of getting rid of some of the juggernauts that are causing such concern in our road system ?
