# text = The amendment will make nonsense unless ( a ) and ( b ) are treated as introducing a separation of meaning into sub- paragraph 2 . All that was necessary in order to produce an elegant amendment , with the effect which the Government desired , was to insert , in line 12 , after " settlement " the words " other than a settlement made by will " .
