# text_id = 1745
# text = Under Section 81 of the Education Act , 1944 , local education authorities are empowered under regulations by the Secretary of State to provide help by way of free meals , for instance , or the provision of transport , the payment of travelling expenses , and various grants for clothing , including P.E. clothing , to enable children to benefit in full from what our schools have to offer .
