# text = If the report on a prisoner is good — if he has tried , has been a good prisoner and worked well — and if the prognosis as to his future is good , then I hope that , irrespective of his notoriety ( which is not of his creation ) the case will be considered on its merits , or demerits , and dealt with as any other .
