# text = The noble Lord , Lord Shepherd , was good enough to refer to his consideration for the interests of the travelling public and I would ask him and his right honourable friend the Minister to keep this before their minds , and although they have these commitments in the Order , not to close their minds to the possibility of continuing the concessions if it appears to be necessary .
