# text_id = 1749
# text = On the third occasion that my right hon . Friend put the question , the Leader of the Opposition rose and gathered his skirts around him as if an assault were intended on his private virtue or as if my right hon . Friend were asking him how much he was paid for his memoirs , and hinted that there was some constitutional impropriety , that there had been some leakage .
