# text_id = 1750
# text = The right hon . Member for Belfast , East ( Mr. Craig ) came close to the heart of the matter when he spoke of the relative decline in our national fortunes in recent years — some economists would say that this started in the 1880s rather than in 1918 or 1945 — turning inward of our people and their growing dissatisfaction with our institutions and system of government .
