# text = For example , company A , which has quietly jogged along not increasing its dividend cover in the period 1972 to 1976 , but which has had a sudden increase in its dividend cover in the last year from once - covered to two - and - a - half - times - covered , could , under the proposed rules , increase its dividend by 150 per cent .
