# text_id = 1754
# text = Now we find that as a result of this Budget any elderly person on a fixed income who wishes to run a car and to continue owning a television set , as the result of this and a previous measure of the present Government , will find that £ 1 a week is taken out of his savings income simply to pay for the licences for those two items .
