# text_id = 1755
# text = The Clause applies to the Bill the provisions of Sections 23 and 24 of the Ministry of Social Security Act , 1966 , which enable the Supplementary Benefits Commission to recover from a husband or father the cost of any supplementary benefit paid to a family and in respect of illegitimate children to obtain affiliation orders or apply for payment under existing orders to be made to the Department .
