# text_id = 1757
# text = It seems to me inconceivable that we should set up two State industries , one in Northern Ireland and one in Great Britain , and that the Leader of the House should then tell my hon . Friends from Ulster , as he did last night , that he has been thinking of devolution not just in terms of Scotland and Wales but possibly in terms of Northern Ireland .
