# text = Is it beyond the wit or the ability of those on the opposite Benches to evolve a scheme such as that which has been evolved between the trade unions and the Government , so that they could see to it that prices did not get out of hand or that we do not get unnecessary increases in the price of biscuits , and we do not have unnecessary investment in luxuries ?
