# text_id = 1761
# text = I take slight heart from a comment made by Mr. Judd during the debate in another place on 29th January when he said that the marriage between the civil and military requirements might have been a marriage of convenience but that such arrangements were not always unhappy , that the Ministry of Defence was not seeking grounds for divorce , although it was looking at the terms of the marriage settlement .
