# text = I will not reopen the arguments which I put forward on Second Reading , but I must confess that on certain aspects of this Bill I was not entirely convinced either by the Attorney - General or by the Home Secretary on whether we are delegating powers to Stormont which Stormont did not have under the 1920 Act and which they did not believe they had under the 1922 legislation .
