# text = Having regard to the important effect that orders made under the two clauses referred to could have upon the admission of new entrants to the industry , and upon the technical solvency of those already engaged in it , the Government are prepared to agree that the affirmative procedure would be appropriate , and that is achieved by the amendment which is parallelled by one put down by the Opposition .
