# text_id = 1764
# text = One danger of a debate of this kind is that of agreeing too much with what everybody says , and I shall therefore follow the right hon . Member for East Ham , North ( Mr. Prentice ) in expressing some qualifications of my welcome to the Bill , though not the same qualifications , and perhaps not such severe ones , as those listed by the right hon . Gentleman .
