# text_id = 1766
# text = They need — they badly need — the kind of services which the Hydrographic Service can provide , and I would hope that those services would be extended , as indeed the Study Group have suggested , to the provision of experts going out and to consultancies , and to the training of their own hydrographers , and that the survey ships would include seagoing training for such personnel .
