# text_id = 1767
# text = I do not disagree with what the noble Earl , Lord Dudley , said , that growth is not everything , but it is absolutely vital to raising living standards ; and I must say to the noble Lord , Lord Milford , that I think he was a little unfair to my noble friend Lord George - Brown in implying that he was not speaking about the workers .
