# text = The other tragedy of the situation is that goods are now going into Rotterdam , Amsterdam and Tilbury , and are being moved from the large tonnage ships on to the small ones so that they come up to Liverpool as heavy loads on the road network , using petrol and diesel fuel that we can ill afford , because we cannot use a deep berth terminal built for the purpose .
