# text_id = 1773
# text = The more we reflect on the story of Governments in this country the more we realise that even if the Minister of State — a man of scrupulous honour and fairness — gave an assurance that there would be no referendum within two months of a General Election , there would be no guarantee that this would hold good if he were no longer a member of the Administration .
