# text = Since there seems to be some confusion and some overlap of law and regulations , I hope that you , Mr. Speaker , as the guardian of this House and the rights of its Members , will give us a definitive , full and authoritative statement of all the constitutional issues which arise in the case of the hon . Member for Mid-Ulster and all the other related matters .
