# text = That is why the committee felt it necessary — and the noble Lord , Lord Rhodes , so ably moved this Motion today — to ask your Lordships to endorse the continuance of MFA , and to ask the Minister , in particular , for effective application of its provisions , for an ordered textile industry with fair competition , and prompt and effective action against those who dishonour their agreements .
