# text_id = 1778
# text = If the introduction of the Bill has done anything , it has forced the Government to deal with the private sector in this regard — and I hope in other regards as well — and allowed us to accept the recommendation of the Lane Report that the Abortion Act , apart from these specific abuses , is working and should remain in force as it is at the moment .
