# text_id = 1780
# text = On the higher rates of income tax , the narrowing of the differentials over the past two years , while we have had an incomes policy effectively restricting higher rates of pay and inflation increasing the cost of living , will build up public pressure for relaxation and changes in the higher rate of income tax much more extensive than those which occurred on the Finance Bill this year .
