# text = I think that the control should be taken away from any Government Department ; that the supervision and control and power to intervene , carefully laid down in legislation , should be given to an independent authority set up by Statute — something on the lines of the Industrial Assurance Commission — with adequate powers to deal with whatever arises from their regular monitoring of the business of every insurance company .
