# text = I hope my hon . Friend the Minister of State can give an account of what is being done to prevent these breaches of the Balfour assurances , or if steps to stop these breaches are not taken by the Government concerned , I hope the British Government will do so by banning the export of live animals to those countries which either cannot or will not honour the assurances .
