# text_id = 1790
# text = Expert manpower is a part of it , but it should not be forgotten that the great expertise resides in the large concerns which over years have built up against the background of their total knowledge and their experience world - wide a capacity to handle a variety of different circum - circumstances in exploration which no individual men , however clever they may be , can possibly match .
