# text = If I may deal with the Amendment that the noble Lord has moved — and I am grateful to him for making it clear from the beginning that it was a probing Amendment — I may say that there are 5 million potential applicants , and neither the Government , the local authorities nor the insulation industry can cope with all of them if they apply at the same time .
