# text = But I hope that my hon . Friend will accept that at present the Government , through a very large public sector borrowing requirement , are financing employment by spending £ 1 for every 80 p they receive in taxes and revenue , and the aim of the present exercise is not to end deficit financing but to bring it down to a level compatible with our financial and economic health .
