# text_id = 1796
# text = The effect of this Amendment , which amends both the English and the Scottish Acts , will be to enable a local planning authority in cases of urgency to effect service of a building preservation notice by affixing it to the building , instead of serving it on the owner and occupier ( in Scotland , the owner , lessee and occupier ) personally , as is required at present .
