# text = This conversion of the Labour Party to the merits of entry when they were in Government , when they had the facts of our national life before them , is one of the few incontrovertible facts in this vast hazy situation that strikes the minds of the public , and I believe that this will have a considerable impact in helping people to make up their minds where the advantage lies .
