# text = On the whole , I accept the balance that the Under - Secretary has suggested between convenience and confidentiality — that where the information can be circulated to another Department only in a form that will ensure that the particulars of individuals cannot be disclosed and that there is no way in which the information can be used to obtan a profile of any individual or firm that is sufficient safeguard .
