# text_id = 1799
# text = My hon . Friend has been looking long and hard at this problem , but surely it cannot be right for local authority borrowers to be paying considerably more than many building society borrowers , particularly bearing in mind that they are generally less well off than building society borrowers and that the houses made available to them are often not those on which building society mortgages are available .
