# text = It is the link between the Atlantic and the Mediterranean in the West , and the Pacific in the East , and — here I endorse what the noble Earl , Lord Cowley , said in this respect — it is of supreme importance for trade ; not merely the oil resources of the Gulf , which we have now learned are so important , but 90 per cent .
