# text = Again , I assume that 41 per cent . has been arrived at because the Government did not want to fall foul of the parliamentary draftsmen and the Public Bill Office , but we should like an assurance that if the Bill ever gets on to the statute book , before the Government start tinkering around with these percentages , industry , and especially small businesses , will be properly consulted .
