# text_id = 1808
# text = But it is depressing the way in which the Government concentrate on the practical difficulties and do not emphasise the fact that it was the last Labour Government that in 1969 , in the Saragat declaration signed by the present Prime Minister — the Government of which the present Foreign Secretary was a prominent member — committed us to direct elections , and that commitment has been honoured by successive Governments .
