# text = One of the documents put before the Select Committee was a memorandum by the Chancellor of the Exchequer , which is set out in Appendix I to the evidence , in which the suggestion was made that provision should be made for the Civil List by a fixed sum plus annual grants - in - aid paid in supplementation of the fixed sum to take account of the increases in cost .
