# text_id = 1811
# text = Since the Irish American community is today the principal source of finance for terrorism in Northern Ireland , will the right hon . Gentleman , when he next meets the Taoiseach , please convey to him the thanks of this House and of the British people for the very courageous and stout - hearted stand of successive Ministers of the Dublin Government when they have visited the United States ?
