# text_id = 1812
# text = In this case — naturally enough , as it is a development land tax — we start with the asset consisting of land , but the clause is drafted in a way which provides for roll - over relief even if the proceeds from the sale of land or the realisation of development value are reinvested in the same groups of other assets as applied for capital gains tax .
