# text = If that were the more important of the two offences with which the court were asked to deal , it is asking a great deal of any tribunal to deal accurately and sympathetically with a case of substance , which may have been a long - contested case , when they know nothing more about it thin a brief summary of the facts from somebody appearing before the court .
