# text = The fact is that the February figure — we welcome the fact that it shows a substantial decrease but we would still point out that that decrease masks a change in the unemploy - ment figures in that , for the first time , at the end of the Christmas holidays , about 20,000 schoolchildren who would have left school and come on to the labour market were retained in school .
