# text = There is no doubt that production is booming , and there is no burning of effigies of my right hon . Friend as befell the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Workington ; and there is no need for my right hon . Friend to call in the Special Branch on his visits to Exeter , as the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Anglesey had to do .
