# text = I will not go into details as to the way that he proposed that it should be done ; but I entirely agree with him that not only should there be a preceding procedure , which has to be gone through before Community law is embodied in our own , but there should also be a retrospective procedure which enables us to reflect , consider and tidy up afterwards .
