# text = I apologise to the hon . Gentleman for interrupting him but , in view of the volume of work which is before the House and the need to get the Bill , may I , through you , Mr. Deputy Speaker , seek to prevail upon hon . Members to mention only salient points and not to go into academic digressions which take up the time of the House ?
