# text_id = 1823
# text = My noble friend and I have confined ourselves to a smaller number of Amendments on this occasion than he put forward on the last occasion , and we have done so in order to raise this general matter of principle in the strongest case , that is why the Deposit of Poisonous Waste Act was passed two years ago as an interim measure pending the introduction of the Bill .
