# text_id = 1826
# text = This suggestion was considered by the council in conjunction with the GLC and the police , and in August 1974 we were informed by the GLC that it did not regard it as really practicable to move the patrol point because it would have been very close to a manufacturing concern , with the possibility of large lorries pulling up near the entrance in order to deliver or collect goods .
