# text_id = 1833
# text = Whatever the answer , I am sure that most hon . Members on both sides of the House will agree that , apart from the overriding short - term problem of inflation , our competitiveness as a nation over many years , under successive Governments , has been undermined by a total inadequacy of industrial investment , both to create capacity and , above all , to advance modernisation .
