# text = We have spent long hours , laborious days and some nights upon the Clause , and it is sad that we are reaching its end — [ Interruption . ] — not sad that we are reaching its end in that sense , but sad that we are reaching its end without any improvement in it to match the consideration we have collectively , jointly and severally given to the matter .
