# text_id = 1838
# text = In other words , in the case of the inshore fishermen mentioned by my hon . and gallant Friend , if they are purchasing a boat of under 15 tons which prima facie , according to the Schedule , is liable to VAT , they can overcome the problem by electing to become a taxable person and in this way take advantage of the credit mechanism and reclaim the input tax .
