# text = When the planning of a new service is at an advanced stage , no one wants that to be interrupted by objection taken to an order of this kind , but the fact remains that the debate upon the order is the only opportunity which the only democratically elected representatives of Northern Ireland have had to consider the policy as well as the application of a big development or change .
