# text = It is a matter for regret that the Solicitor - General persists in his selective quotations from the Report of the Royal Commission and , incidentally , keeps on pretending to the House and the country at large — why he should accuse us of misrepresenting the Bill I do not know — that in this respect the Government are in line with Donovan , when clearly they are not .
