# text_id = 1845
# text = The Domestic Violence Act has given , and I am bound to say is continuing to give , a fairly substantial amount of trouble in the courts , and I think it would be going too far to impose on the magistrates the burden of coping with these very difficult cases in addition to those they will already have to deal with under the clause as it currently stands .
