# text_id = 1848
# text = On the specific point my hon . Friend mentioned about a recommendation by my Department that the airport should continue in operation for 20 years , I assume that he is referring to the clauses in the conveyance and agreement governing the transfer of the airport to the local authorities which provide that my Department can repurchase the airport if it ceases to be licensed for public use within 21 years .
