# text_id = 1850
# text = We on these Benches have never supported food subsidies , but for months and years we have been urging the Government to increase the family allowance so that those who have to meet the basic needs of bringing up a family would know for certain that there was more money coming in to offset , at any rate to some extent , the rising prices with which they are confronted .
