# text = Even where for compelling reasons — and I think they need to be compelling reasons now — the law in Northern Ireland has to be different in principle , as in this case , from that in the rest of the United Kingdom , I hope that the Government will find it possible to deal by legislation with at any rate major matters of the kind we are considering .
