# text_id = 1852
# text = I believe that it is of the first importance that Britain should play the leading rôle in creating a European foreign policy , so that as a nation and as a continent we can speak with authority , so that the aspirations and interests of the British and European peoples can be taken account of and that this should be done in the closest consultation with our American allies .
