# text = If the Government are not prepared to accept these amendments , one cannot avoid coming to the conclusion that the only reason why the Bill is before us is that it will keep the Lib - Lab pact going , will gain a little support in the SNP and will enable Ministers to go on drawing their salaries for a little longer than they would otherwise be able to do .
