# text_id = 1855
# text = If , for instance , the words " by adding to " had been left out of the Bill and I had put down an amendment seeking to include them , you would rightly have ruled it out of order , because it would have widened the scope of the increased VAT rate band , thereby increasing taxation , and it is out of order to do things of that sort .
