# text_id = 1857
# text = The two sets of circumstances are , first , the single transaction of a finance company , rigidly documented in full and often contracted with an unknown borrower ; and , secondly , the informal arrangement , which has been referred to so often and which has been so long - established , between a clearing bank branch manager and his customer based largely on mutual knowledge , trust and understanding .
