# text = I wonder whether the noble Baroness — and since I do not wish to be provocative I should like to ask her to give this to the Committee rather than myself — would agree that at the end of three or three and a half years of Conservative Government we were in fact building fewer houses both for private and municipal occupation than was the case a decade ago .
