# text = If the operative staff of the MRC engaged in this division of its activities are merely going to be transferred en bloc and continue to function in their new guise as they have been functioning , I imagine that the only possible objection can be that it must increase the total overheads by having to institute a board with its pay , premises , and other emoluments and expenditures .
