# text = It is almost ironic that I should have spoken for the Conservative group in the European Parliament for so many years about the British steel industry and its position vis-a - vis the European steel industry , and have urged time and again the need for a plan such as the Davignon plan and the proposals that we are now debating relating to State aids for the steel industry .
