# text = In view of the sums of money likely to be involved , I am sure the House will agree that it is only common prudence to take the necessary steps to arm the Intervention Board with adequate powers to police the operation of its many and various functions , to prevent fraud , as far as is possible and to discover at once if any fraud has been perpetrated .
