# text_id = 1874
# text = I say to the House , even more emphatically than did the hon . Member for Southampton , Test , by all means let us pass a resolution — it will sharpen our minds if it does nothing else — which in terms requires that assent shall not be given in the Council of Ministers to proposals of the Commission until they have been submitted to the opinion of this House .
