# text_id = 1878
# text = When I asked the noble Lord , Lord Shackleton , yesterday ( I hope he will not mind my saying this ) about his new role , he said that he and Lord Greenwood had decided while on that Bench , evidently after a little debate between themselves , to model themselves on the figure of the noble Lord , Lord Nugent of Guildford , whom they had admired .
