# text_id = 1879
# text = If my right hon . Friend will not place a total embargo on council house sales in the London area , I ask him at least to call a halt to sales until the issue of the transfer of estates has been determined , so that the GLC does not get the opportunity to sell off property — and some of the best property — before a transfer takes place .
