# text_id = 1880
# text = My Bill simply imposes a requirement that if a United Kingdom firm 's name or trademark , or any United Kingdom place name or anything which the public might take to be a United Kingdom firm 's name or trade mark or a place in the United Kingdom , appears on imported goods , it must be accompanied by a clear and conspicuous statement of the country of origin .
