# text = In the case of the Anglican Church , our minds go back a few months to the occasion when the Vacant Benefices Measure was before the House and when , for the first time since 1928 , this House threw out a measure that came to us through the Anglican processes , it having been through the Synod and having been before the Ecclesiastical Committee of the Anglican Church .
