# text_id = 1882
# text = Again , I hope that a third bridge will go across the Kyle of Sutherland between Tain and Dornoch , and that when that happens it will be very largely causeway , which , consistently made wide enough to carry a railway track , can save another 11 or more miles of railway track and can bring the whole East coast of Sutherland into the commuter belt of Tain and Nigg .
