# text = But where the registration is , by vrtue of Clause 64 , provisional — that is to say , where the rent limit imediately before registration exceeds the registered rent and the Secretary of State has directed a special rent limit — the registration cannot be said to have taken effect and there is , therefore , no date as from whch the period of three years could run .
