# text_id = 1885
# text = As a liberal man — [ Interruption . ] — who tries to moderate his language as best he can , I remind the House that the Secretary of State for Employment said only a few weeks ago that he will not introduce an order under the Equal Pay Act , which he could do , to guarantee women 90 per cent . of the comparable wage in comparable work .
